---@class posthog.llm_skills.ListLlmSkillsManifestsRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field category? string Filter skills to this exact category. Pass "scout" for Signals scouts, or an empty string to return only uncategorized skills. Omit the parameter entirely to return skills of every category.
---@field created_by_id? number Filter skills by the ID of the user who created them.
---@field exclude_category? string Leave out skills in this exact category, e.g. "scout" to skip Signals scouts. An empty string leaves out uncategorized skills.
---@field limit? number Number of results to return per page.
---@field offset? number The initial index from which to return the results.
---@field owner_id? number Filter skills by the ID of a user who owns them. Ownership is keyed on the logical skill, so this is stable across versions — unlike created_by_id, which tracks whoever published the latest version.
---@field search? string Optional substring filter applied to skill names and descriptions.

---@class posthog.llm_skills.ListLlmSkillsRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field category? string Filter skills to this exact category. Pass "scout" for Signals scouts, or an empty string to return only uncategorized skills. Omit the parameter entirely to return skills of every category.
---@field created_by_id? number Filter skills by the ID of the user who created them.
---@field limit? number Number of results to return per page.
---@field offset? number The initial index from which to return the results.
---@field owner_id? number Filter skills by the ID of a user who owns them. Ownership is keyed on the logical skill, so this is stable across versions — unlike created_by_id, which tracks whoever published the latest version.
---@field search? string Optional substring filter applied to skill names and descriptions.

